spect_system_deltas_for_nitrogen, inspect_specific_system_in_specific_tick, largest_mover_identifies_dominant_system, water_change_shows_n_export_via_system_deltas, trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers, step_and_inspect_returns_snapshot, multiple_inspections_are_independent, o2_balance_check_with_aeration, debug_output_does_not_panic, net_delta_accessor_matches_before_after.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"description\": \"Fixed pre-existing compilation error: added missing death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction field (default 1.0) to tank_scenarios process_preset_to_params conversion.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test (all 215 tests pass including 12 new), cargo clippy (clean), cargo fmt --check (clean).\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test: 215 tests pass across all crates (12 new in budget_helpers test file)\",\n    \"cargo clippy: zero warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check: zero diffs\",\n    \"closed_system_n_and_c_conserved_via_helpers test retrofits the existing closed-system conservation pattern using single-call assert_n_conserved/assert_c_conserved + assert_per_tick_balanced\",\n    \"inspect_system_deltas_for_nitrogen verifies a test can see which system produced nitrogen movement in a given tick\",\n    \"TANK_BUDGET_DEBUG env-var path exercised without panics (debug_output_does_not_panic test); actual stderr output verified manually with TANK_BUDGET_DEBUG=1\",\n    \"Budget helpers compile with zero overhead when budget tracking is disabled (step_and_inspect enables tracking only when called; BudgetInspector is not constructed unless requested)\",\n    \"All assertion functions are single-call (assert_n_conserved, assert_c_conserved, assert_o2_balanced, assert_budget_balanced, assert_per_tick_balanced) — no multi-line manual pool arithmetic needed\",\n    \"Assertion AP